evidence sentiment_analyzer_0 {
    source: "Agent: sentiment_analyzer (Claude API)"
    summary: "Based on my research, there appears to be substantial and broad-based support for Ukraine among the voting public and political leadership in the EU. Public opinion polls, parliamentary votes, and statements from key European leaders all indicate a high degree of solidarity with Ukraine in its conflict with Russia."
